  "description": "When we created our three-model line of police bikes, we did so with the understanding that lives are at stake every time these bikes are in use. That's why every model is spec'd with parts made by only the most reputable of manufacturers and backed by a brand with almost 50 years of history behind it. When your equipment must perform flawlessly, look no further than our PD1, PD2 or PD4 models; three rock solid bikes to match three different budgets and intended uses.\nHaro PD1 frame made from X6 6000-series alloy featuring internal cable routing\nSuntour XCE-28 fork w/ 100mm travel and pre-load adjustment\nAlloy forged crankset w/ steel 32T chainring and plastic guard, 175mm\nMicroshift RD-M5185M Acolyte mid-cage rear derailleur w/ clutch\nMicroshift SL-M7180-R Express 8-spd shifter\n27.5\" double-wall aluminum rims w/23mm inner diameter\nAlloy quick release, 6-bolt disc compatible hubs\nStainless steel spokes\nKenda Kwick 27.5\"x2.20\" w/ reflective sidewalls\nPromax DSK-320 mechanical brakes w/ 160mm rotors\nExtras: Rear rack, chainstay- mounted kick stand, police branding and alloy bottle cage",
